WEBVTT

00:00:00.762 --> 00:00:01.408
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:03.612
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> Can I help you?

00:00:03.944 --> 00:00:05.654
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> I’m just looking, thank you.

00:00:07.607 --> 00:00:08.265
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:10.622
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> What size are you?

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:12.127
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> I’m a medium.

00:00:14.315 --> 00:00:15.036
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:16.159 --> 00:00:17.542
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> Can I try on this shirt?

00:00:17.926 --> 00:00:21.082
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> Yes, the changing rooms are over there.

00:00:23.156 --> 00:00:23.808
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:24.945 --> 00:00:26.258
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> This shirt doesn’t fit me.

00:00:26.878 --> 00:00:28.097
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> It’s too big for me.

00:00:30.215 --> 00:00:31.028
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:34.355
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> That jacket really suits you!

00:00:34.997 --> 00:00:36.733
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> You always look good in red.

00:00:38.861 --> 00:00:39.655
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:40.703 --> 00:00:42.925
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> I’m going to take these trousers back.

00:00:43.401 --> 00:00:44.352
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> They’re too short.